{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01808","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离 · 沈佺期","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白水东悠悠，中有西行舟。\n舟行有返棹，水去无还流。\n奈何生别者，戚戚怀远游。\n远游谁当惜，所悲会难收。\n自君间芳躧，青阳四五遒。\n皓月掩兰室，光风虚蕙楼。\n相思无明晦，长叹累冬秋。\n离居分迟暮，驾高何淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}